                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The wheel has delivered again.\n\nSurprisingly good, short horror point and click. The scares are simple as is the art and even the logic behind the puzzles, but it has a certain charm to it and honestly I'd rather my point and clicks be straightforward than horribly obtuse.\n\nI don't really have much else to say about this one, I completed it in 25 minutes, 2 of the scares got me, and it was enjoyable beginning to end. Impressive little free game. It's a shame the developer doesn't have any other games, I would have considered picking one up if they had any for sale.",
